---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Griffith Creative — Web Design & SEO for Growing Businesses"
  description="Griffith Creative builds high-performance websites and runs SEO campaigns for small and mid-sized businesses. Based in Los Angeles, built for companies across the US."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 fade-in">
          Based in Los Angeles. Built for businesses across the US.
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-8 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          Your website should be<br />
          <span class="text-accent">closing deals,</span><br />
          not collecting dust.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-10 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          We build websites and run SEO for small and mid-sized businesses. What traditional agencies take months to deliver, we ship in weeks, at a fraction of the cost.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="bg-accent text-dark font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-center hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors"
          >
            Start Your Project
          </a>
          <a
            href="/services"
            class="border border-offwhite/20 text-offwhite font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-center hover:border-offwhite/40 transition-colors"
          >
            View Services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem/Solution -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 fade-in">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
          Most agency websites are overpriced and underbuilt.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
          You've seen the pitch: six figures, six months, and a site that loads slower than your patience runs out. Your customers are searching for you right now. They're finding your competitors instead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-dark-tertiary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in">
          <div class="text-accent text-3xl font-bold mb-3">1–3 Weeks</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Fast Delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            No six-month timelines. We scope tight, build fast, and launch on schedule. Your site goes live while competitors are still in "discovery."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-dark-tertiary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="text-accent text-3xl font-bold mb-3">No Bloat</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Honest Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Agency-quality output without the agency markup. We use modern tools and AI-driven workflows to cut overhead, not corners.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-dark-tertiary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="text-accent text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Built to Be Cited</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">SEO + AI Search</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every site is engineered to rank on Google and get cited by ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews. Structured for both crawlers and language models.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Search Visibility -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            AI Search Visibility
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
            Get found by AI,<br />not just Google.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Half your customers aren't Googling anymore. They're asking ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity for the best plumber, lawyer, or contractor in town. If your site isn't structured for AI to read and cite, you're invisible to that traffic.
          </p>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
            We build sites that language models actually quote, with the schema, structure, and authority signals that make your business the answer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Structured for Language Models</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Schema.org markup, clean semantic HTML, and an llms.txt file so AI crawlers can parse exactly who you are, what you do, and who you serve.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Citation-Worthy Content</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Question-and-answer formatting, statistics, and direct claims that AI models prefer to quote when generating responses for your prospective customers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Entity & Authority Signals</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Consistent business identity across the web, including directories, reviews, and references, so AI models recognize you as a credible source worth recommending.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">AI Visibility Tracking</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We monitor how the major AI engines describe your business and adjust the site so your name shows up when prospects ask the questions that matter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Work With -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            Who We Work With
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
            Businesses that need to be found and trusted online.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Your customers decide whether to trust you before they ever pick up the phone. We build digital presences that earn that trust: clean, professional, and optimized to convert.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Service Businesses</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              From professional practices to home services. If your business depends on trust and reputation, your website needs to reflect that. We build sites that convert visitors into clients.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Local Businesses</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Brick-and-mortar shops, multi-location operators, and local service providers. Local SEO that literally puts you on the map, plus a website that closes the deal.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Growing Companies</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              B2B firms, consultancies, and startups that have outgrown their DIY website and need a digital presence that matches the caliber of their work.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          How It Works
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">
          Three steps. No runaround.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div class="text-center fade-in">
          <div class="text-accent text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Discovery Call</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A 15-minute call to understand your business, your customers, and your goals. We'll define scope and timeline on the spot.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="text-accent text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Build & Review</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We build your site and send a working preview within days. Two rounds of revisions included. You stay focused on your business while we handle the rest.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="text-accent text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Launch & Grow</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your site goes live. If you opt for ongoing SEO, we start driving organic traffic immediately. Monthly reports, real results, no guesswork.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        Ready to stop losing clients<br />to a better website?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Get a site that actually works for your business. No long contracts, no surprise invoices, no nonsense.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-lg"
      >
        Let's Talk
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
